== ordered: head retry keeps order, a refusal parks and later records pass
ran: a#0 flaky#0 flaky#1 flaky#2 refused#0 b#0
parked: refused/other; records on disk: 1

== keyed: a new post replaces the pending job and cancels the running one
ran: other#0 slow.1#0 slow.3#0
records on disk: 0

== restart: records persist, undecodable ones are set aside, held submissions wait
ran: x#0; set aside: 00000000000000000001-00000000-1.bad
after release: x#0 held#0

== pause holds everything
while paused: [], pending 1
after resume: p#0
